<title>USA: St Louis feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Louis feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>EAST ST LOUIS, Ill. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FEEDER CATTLE AUCTION:   250 head. Compared with last week, limited supply</p>
<p>feeder steers and heifers steady. Moderate buyer attendance.</p>
<p>FEEDER STEERS: Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>Thin: 300-400 lbs. 83.00-88.00, Crossbreds 88.00-90.00</p>
<p>400-500 lbs. 80.00-86.00, Crossbreds 86.00-89.00</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 77.00-84.00, Crossbreds 84.00-87.00</p>
<p>Moderately Fleshy:  400-600 lbs. 74.00-80.00</p>
<p>LARGE FRAME 2 HOLSTEINS:</p>
<p>400-800 lbs. 59.00-62.00</p>
<p>FEEDER HEIFERS:  Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>Thin:     400-500 lbs. 72.00-78.00, Crossbreds 78.00-82.00</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 70.00-76.00, Crossbreds 76.00-80.00</p>
<p>600-700 lbs. 68.00-73.00</p>
<p>700-900 lbs. 60.00-68.00</p>
<p>Moderately Fleshy: 400-700 lbs. 66.00-72.00</p>
<p>Receipts  250  Last week  250  Last Year 200</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
